("**OP3 — BELIEF CHOOSES; TRUTH RESOLVES.** What a traveller can see as a chance is what its SENDING court believes (or, for a paragon, its own picture — CH7): a captive it has heard is held there, a court it believes hostile, a way it does not know. The attempt's outcome rolls against truth (the catch law's own words: \"PURE and TRUTH-SIDE\"). A believed captive who is not there costs the stop and is receipted; the omniscient info mode reads truth for both (the house's arm).",
 "**OP3 — THE TRAVELLER CHOOSES ON WHAT IT CARRIED AND WHAT IT SEES; TRUTH RESOLVES.** A chance is listed only on a LAWFUL road (RULINGS-P6 A.5): (a) PRESENCE — standing in a town, the traveller sees who that town's cells hold, how the town receives its court's man (the catch law's own truth read) and the town's open state (CH §14 road (a); the owner's \"coincidentally … in the same city\"); (b) WHAT IT CARRIED FROM HOME — its departure picture (`envoyDeparturePicture`, frozen: \"Nothing is re-read from live truth\") and its court's own man held as a ROADS hostage (the ransom its court pays names the captor, `RansomRec.homeId · captorId`); (c) its court's LIVE belief only where ES §3.7's magic transmission sends it. NEVER `envoy_held` evidence or any WR-7b fact (\"all nine immediate WR-7b facts are DM-only\", the certification row of `envoyDiplomacyEnabled`), never wizardNews, never the court's live belief otherwise; a capture told on the rumor road would be a NEW RN telling source (RN's `DEED_SOURCES` hold no capture) — ROUTED to RN's P7 row, and until it is accepted, nothing. A PARAGON reads its own picture (CH7). The attempt's outcome rolls against truth (the catch law's own words: \"PURE and TRUTH-SIDE\"). A chance believed one stop off that is not there on arrival costs the stop and is receipted `not_there`; the omniscient info mode reads truth for both (the house's arm). " + C + "OP-r1-1 · OP-r1-3: the census no longer reads `envoy_held` evidence, wizardNews or the sending court's live belief]"),
