("**OP11 — A FALSE WORD IS A PLANT CARRIED BY A PERSON; ONE BELIEF WRITER.** A traveller's false report is IN's plant with a carrier, delivered on the carrier's arrival tick and folded by `processLies`, the sole belief/disinfo writer; its weight at the hearer is the carrier's composite credibility; its exposure charges the carrier's person and court credibility through the landed deltas. A lawful carrier is unwilling (`lieWillingness`). Never a second belief writer, never a free-text lie.",
 "**OP11 — A FALSE WORD IS THE LANDED BLUFF, SPOKEN BY A PERSON; ONE BELIEF WRITER.** A traveller's false report is the LANDED SELF-BLUFF — its court's own strength told one step stronger (`assertedBand = clamp(selfBand + INFLATE_BANDS, 0, 4)`, `subjectId: liarId`) — with the carrier stamped as the bluff's D-2 mouthpiece (`spokespersonNpcId`), seeded on the carrier's arrival tick by `processLies`, the sole belief/disinfo writer; its weight at the hearer is the composite credibility (the court's × the carrier's); its exposure charges the court and the mouthpiece through the landed deltas. A claim about a THIRD court is IN's to shape (a declared carried-plant shape — ROUTED to IN); until IN declares one, OP carries only the self-bluff. A lawful-GOOD carrier is unwilling; restraint fades with malice (`lieWillingness`: `restraint = LAWGOOD_RESTRAINT × l × (1 − m)`; a lawful-evil envoy lies readily — `skeptic/OP-r1-probe/lieWillingness.out`) — the landed arithmetic stands, no second lawful bar (RULINGS-P6 B.1). Never a second belief writer, never a free-text lie. " + C + "OP-r1-9 · OP-r1-10]"),
